{"4211910": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Final Word Royale", "steam_appid": 4211910, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Final Word Royale</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Final Word Royale is a deadly word-based battle royale where 20-40 players compete to solve scrambled words. Fail, and you’ll lose a finger or face a shot. Only one can survive.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4211910/extras/6827246bd15f9f7869365c1968e4cafd.avif?t=1770091168\" width=1232 height=706 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Word-based Battle Royale</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Survive in a deadly game where 40 players battle to crack 5-letter codes. Each failed attempt means losing a finger or worse.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4211910/extras/2d850b8b65b8e5425f5e5c47d9ad95dd.webp?t=1770091168\" width=471 height=50 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Face off in 1v1 duels where every word matters. Fail to solve the scrambled word in time, and you'll lose a finger or face a devastating shot. Only one will make it to the next round.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4211910/extras/9102229a11734ef4b4e8bf399ac5c0f8.poster.avif?t=1770091168\" width=750 height=422 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4211910/extras/9102229a11734ef4b4e8bf399ac5c0f8.webm?t=1770091168\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4211910/extras/9102229a11734ef4b4e8bf399ac5c0f8.mp4?t=1770091168\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4211910/extras/0138b7cc8363f12b2adbda3452e15609.webp?t=1770091168\" width=320 height=50 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fail and pay the price — either cut off a finger or be shot. Track your progress and see how you rank in this brutal word duel.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4211910/extras/585660863759212a40c95893f437c658.poster.avif?t=1770091168\" width=750 height=422 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4211910/extras/585660863759212a40c95893f437c658.webm?t=1770091168\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4211910/extras/585660863759212a40c95893f437c658.mp4?t=1770091168\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4211910/extras/60670f198b70e6a5c375c81e77b41742.webp?t=1770091168\" width=690 height=50 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Survive in a deadly game where 40 players battle to crack 5-letter codes. Each failed attempt means losing a finger or worse.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4211910/extras/10a606e93ce311e12893984f5e32c67c.poster.avif?t=1770091168\" width=750 height=422 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4211910/extras/10a606e93ce311e12893984f5e32c67c.webm?t=1770091